  _headline: "Bairro ganha banco pr\xF3prio e at\xE9 moeda nova"
  _headlineEn: Neighborhood gets its own bank and even a new currency
  _body: "Cr\xE9dito pequeno, juros baixos e dinheiro girando no com\xE9rcio local.
    Dona Cida j\xE1 aceita a moeda nova no balc\xE3o da padaria."
  _bodyEn: Small loans, low interest and money circulating in local shops. Mrs. Cida
    already takes the new currency at the bakery counter.
